PASS  wildcard wildcard label remains under .example.com
FAIL  wildcard SAN cannot escape .example.com: permitted ['DNS:.example.com'] on *.evil.com
FAIL  excluded DNS subtree: excluded ['DNS:.blocked.example.com'] on x.blocked.example.com
FAIL  SAN present, CN fallback disabled: permitted ['DNS:.example.com'] on evil.com
PASS  CN fallback accepted when SAN absent
FAIL  CN fallback rejected when SAN absent: permitted ['DNS:.example.com'] on evil.com

